        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions Model #10 6 Foot Stainless Steel Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n6 feet (72 inches) long Model #10 large stainless steel door pull from First Impressions can be used in many applications such as commercial office entry doors,  store front doors, large appliance doors, just about anywhere a large door pull is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/first-impressions-model-10-6-feet.jpg?v=1704442269\" width=\"600\" height=\"94\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions Model #10 6 feet long door pull\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other lengths: <br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-pioneer-door-pull-first-impressions-pnr150smts4\"><b>24\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/3-foot-stainless-steel-door-pull-first-impressions-pnr150036smts4\"><b>36\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a><br> \r\n<a href=\"/products/4-foot-long-stainless-steel-pioneer-door-pull-first-impressions-pnr150048smts4\"><b>48\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/5-foot-long-commercial-door-pull-first-impressions-model-10-60-us32d\"><b>60\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a><br> \r\n<!-- <a href=\"/products/6-foot-long-commercial-door-pull-first-impressions-model-10-72-us32d\"><b>72\" Stainless Steel Door Pull</b></a><br> -->\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLong lasting Satin Stainless Steel door pull with a very clean contemporary design. The large 1-1/2\" diameter pull handle is easy to grab and makes a bold statement. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p clas=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions Model #10/72-US32D Stainless Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Total Length: 72\" ( 6' )</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 54\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b> Pull Handle</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: The First Impressions Model #10 door pull is available in lengths up to 10 feet and the Center to Center Mounting distance can be adjusted for your specific application. Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact Us</b></a> with your requirements.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
